    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a challenging yet fascinating subject for me. While I don't have a deep love for it like some of my peers who excel in physics or computer science, I appreciate its logical structure and problem-solving aspects. It's not something I avoid, but I certainly don't seek it out either. My relationship with math is more about respecting its precision than feeling passionate about it.",
